Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.999,44.667)}The Real Life Video Game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So these stars, spears, swords come flying at you from nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're this ninja and have to dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You get #10 points, if you make it to the end of the round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,#10 points, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if an enemy Samurai appears, you have to but go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't dodge it in time, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have only three lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That means failing thrice is game over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a go, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, move right, fast!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.11,0:01:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer simple games like this, for once!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked hard to get my hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tough game...\NBut I've already got to #50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn! I only got to #190 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\N-#190 points?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnets are something, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get a dozens of Zeroes at first, but have heart, my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's very hard for first-timers...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, I got #310 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You must be kidding me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so good, Suneo-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really good at games like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, please give us a second chance!? Pretty pleaseee~...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll be sure to get 500 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta practice, so soooorrrrry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya~!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nice thing you have got there in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to give it to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that face of yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm... welll... It's nothing really....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too easy for you, Giant... \NYou'll get bored of it in no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I only made it to #170 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! This is too easy for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it to #310 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} made it to #190 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But for me, it was just luck...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, gimme one more chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be #1 in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, this time I'll...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, please gimme back my game...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be borrowing this till I best all o' you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a while, I do gymnastics!\N 'Yo, it feels so refreshin'!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? You look down...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that Giant took away your NInja game...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lemme have it for a while", he said..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But Giant never returns anything he takes from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It cost me three years of my savings, but now it's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.55,GadgetCard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,426.333)}The Real Life Video Game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see you crying like this, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's this supposed to be? It's a see-through screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It uses real people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Real people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,FIrst, you try it out, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,First set the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next set the moving screen....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, set the background!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Last, hit the preset button and we're good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The falling objects will be different,...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But otherwise it uses the same principles as the good ol' Ninja game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Game start!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play it outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It uses the holographic objects that vanish upon falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It only hurts so little when hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no fun game for the target person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, play my game all you want, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,First, set the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then set the background...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's playtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hit the preset button and we're good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What 'da hell???!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Game start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,#10 points won!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Next up #20 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What 'da hell is goin' on 'ere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can restart the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sum 'un, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, so it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Left... Oops, right...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo saw us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:06:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.87,0:07:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bully Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The principles are the same as the good ol' Ninja game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wut 'da hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two more rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are getting tough and interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He had got #310 points earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He ain't worth even #10 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're deliberately getting him hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you found me out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm payin' him back for the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One more try, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No! \N-I see you up there!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is payback!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it hit Mr. Kaminari's window!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you, little punk...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is just like a real Ninja game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna uproot Suneo's score!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish this would last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I had enough of this!
